  "result": "Excellent! All 414 tests pass. Here's a summary of the polished renderInvoiceText improvements:\n\n## Enhanced Invoice Text Rendering\n\n**New Features Added:**\n\n1. **Line-level discounts**: Each line now shows its discount in parentheses if it has one\n   - Example: `5 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac425.00 (-\u20ac42.50)`\n   - Includes both line discounts and bulk discounts (qty \u2265 10)\n\n2. **Voucher display**: Shows the voucher amount just before the total\n   - Example: `Voucher: -\u20ac50.00`\n\n3. **Due date**: Shows when the invoice is due\n   - Example: `Due: 2026-11-06`\n   - Only shown if invoice has a dueDate\n\n4. **Amount paid**: Shows how much has been paid so far\n   - Example: `Paid: \u20ac1,205.95`\n   - Only shown if invoice has payment records\n\n**Example Output:**\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n5 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac425.00 (-\u20ac42.50)\n15 x Development (hour) @ \u20ac95.00 = \u20ac1,425.00 (-\u20ac105.09)\nVoucher: -\u20ac50.00\nVAT: \u20ac357.50\nTotal: \u20ac2,009.91\nDue: 2026-11-06\nPaid: \u20ac1,205.95\n```\n\n**Rendering Order:**\n1. Invoice number (or \"DRAFT\")\n2. Customer name\n3. Line items (with discounts if applicable)\n4. Voucher (if present)\n5. VAT (if > 0)\n6. Total\n7. Due date (if present)\n8. Amount paid (if payments exist)\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n- 9 new tests covering all enhancement features\n- Tests for discount display, voucher, due date, and payment tracking\n- Edge case testing (no voucher, no payments, fully paid)\n- Comprehensive integration test with all features combined\n\n**Test Results:** All 414 tests passing",
